  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ロイヤルマスクの　ふくめん。\nプロレスラー　みずから\nミシンで　ぬっているらしい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "로열마스크의 복면.\n프로레슬러 스스로\n재봉틀로 누빈 듯하다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "皇家蒙面人的面罩。\n好像是職業摔角手\n自己用縫紉機縫製的。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le masque de Royal Mask !\nOn raconte que ce catcheur professionnel\naurait cousu son costume lui-même.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Die Maske von Mask Royale. Der Profi-Wrestler\nhat sie selbst mit der Nähmaschine genäht.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "La máscara de luchador de Royale, el Enmascarado.\nMuy probablemente de factura propia.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Maschera di Mister Royale.\nSembra che il famoso lottatore l’abbia realizzata\npersonalmente.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The mask that belongs to The Masked Royal.\nThis pro wrestler apparently sews his mask on a\nmachine himself.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ロイヤルマスクの　覆面。\nプロレスラー　自ら\nミシンで　縫っているらしい。",
